        <p n="32">At the line end the edition opens a bracket; it is not closed and is closed here at the line end.</p>
        <p n="33">The bracket after ϫ is not closed in the edition; it is closed here at the line end.</p>
        <p n="34">The editors print "nicht gelesen" (not read); no text is given.</p>
        <p n="35">Lines 35–36: the editors print, with a brace over both lines, "stark abgerieben" (badly rubbed off); no text is given.</p>
        <p n="36">See l. 35.</p>
        <p n="37">Below the last line the editors remark "Am unteren Rande eine Zeile" (one line in the bottom margin); it is not transcribed here.</p>
